# Netlify / Cloudflare Pages redirects
#
# The homepage is canonically "/" (see site.config.json), but a static host
# will happily serve /index.html as well. Two live URLs for one page splits
# the site's own signals, so the .html form is 301'd to the clean root.

/index.html   /   301

# Defensive: the other common spelling of the same file.
/index.htm    /   301
